  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> for every natural number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> is equal to _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "27560",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So the sequence is an A.P. with first term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and common difference&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>i.e., <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p>We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8721;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>27560</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
